$(1)$ Find the value of $p$;  
$(2)$ Let $F$ be the focus of $y^{2}=2px$, and $M$ and $N$ be two points on the parabola such that $\overrightarrow{MF}\cdot \overrightarrow{NF}=0$. Find the minimum area of triangle $MNF$.

